@format 1
@id project.delete-scene
@title Delete named scene
@area 7. Project persistence
@entry input
@summary Show the current scene-preset controls and the missing UI route to the existing persistent deletion method.
@section II. Functionality
@flow TB
@related project.save-scene, project.load-scene, project.import-scene, project.export-scene

@alias console = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PConsole
@alias scene = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LScene

[input] Scene controls are attached <input>
- Attach Save, Export, Import, selection, and dropdown handlers to the scene-preset controls @ console.PConsoleSceneAttach(...)
> capability

[capability] Is a delete action exposed? <decision>
- Build and attach no delete button, dropdown-row removal command, or deletion event handler @ console.PConsoleSceneAttach(...)
? "Available current controls" > unavailable

[unavailable] Deletion cannot be requested <error>
- Keep the persistent deletion operation unreachable from the current scene-preset UI @ scene.LSceneDelete(...)
= A named scene can be saved, loaded, imported, and exported, but it cannot be removed through the interface.
